    "bbox": [
      63.26,
      0.47,
      565.42,
      236.8
    ],
    "text": "Based on the heavy rainfall currently being experienced over the Nilwala River Basin, together with an analysis of the water levels recorded at river gauging stations maintained by the Irrigation Department within the Nilwala River Basin, a Minor Flood Situation is likely to occur within the next 24 hours in low-lying areas of the Nilwala River floodplain within the Pasgoda, Kotapola, Pitabeddara, Akuressa, Athuraliya, Malimbada, Kamburupitiya and Thihagoda Divisional Secretariat Divisions. The general public residing in these areas and vehicle drivers travelling through the affected areas are hereby requested to exercise extreme caution in view of this situation. The relevant Disaster Management Authorities are requested to take necessary precautionary measures in this regard.",
